    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSeeking offers over 249,000\n\nThis is a well-presented duplex of some 96 sqm with spectacular views over Wexford town out as far as Ferrybank and The Raven Nature Reserve. The property is not overlooked and offers great privacy given it's first floor entry point. Ideally positioned in Cromwellsfort Grove, located directly opposite the green area and playground with parking to both the front and rear of the property.\nOn the first floor is a large living room with views and double doors to the kitchen/dining area. This area is well-appointed and naturally bright with window and glazed rear door. There is also the convenience of a guest toilet on this floor.\nUpstairs there are three bedrooms and a family bathroom; the main bedroom to the front comes with an ensuite and has amazing views over Wexford town. Two of the bedrooms also have built-in storage.\nThere is an enclosed rear garden which is grassed, and the gate leads to a parking area to the rear.\nRecent energy upgrades include:-\n- External Wall Insulation\n- Attic Insulation and water tank insulation\n- Attic walkway to water tank and storage area fitted with boards\n- Main Fireplace sealed\n- Hot water tank lagging upgraded\n- TRV valves fitted to all radiators upstairs and downstairs\n\n96 sqm duplex, 3 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, guest toilet downstairs, mains services, opposite green area, smoke alarms in every room, monitored alarm system, broadband available. Maintenance Fee 600 per annum, Sherry Fitz Mgmt Ltd."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.8m x 1.9m\nwith laminate flooring and alarm panel. Guest WC off\n\nLiving Room - 4.9m x 3.9m\nwith laminate flooring, electric fire in hearth (chimney has been sealed to improve BER), window to the front over balcony area. Double doors lead to -\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 5.9m x 3.4m\nwith tiled flooring, waist and eye level units, 1.9m counter return providing for extra storage (plumbed underneath) and workspace. Rear door leads to stairs to rear garden area\n\nGuest WC - 1.7m x 0.8m\nwith linoleum flooring, WC and WHB, extractor fan\n\nLanding - 3.7m x 1.6m\nwith carpet\n\nHot Press - 1m x 0.8m\nshelved\n\nBathroom - 2m x 1.75m\nfully tiled with WC, WHB, bath with electric shower over. Wall mounted heater as well as radiator, extractor fan\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.2m x 3.8m\nmeasurement includes en-suite area. With carpet, built-in triple wardrobe, extractor fan\n\nEn-Suite - 1.7m x 1.7m\nfully tiled with WC, WHB and electric shower. Wall mounted heater as well as radiator\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.5m x 2.8m\nrear facing room with carpet flooring and built-in double wardrobe\n\nBedroom 3 - 3m x 2.5m\nrear facing room with carpet\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>96 sqm duplex</li><li>B rated BER</li><li>Fenced rear garden</li><li>Turn-key condition throughout</li><li>Three bedrooms, main with en-suite</li><li>Living room with kitchen/dining to the rear</li><li>Bathroom and ensuite upstairs, guest toilet downstairs</li><li>OFCH, mains services, Extractor fans in all bathrooms</li><li>Contents can be purchased separately</ul>"
      },
